-      </div>
-      <div>
-        <span class="eyebrow">Toolkit 02</span>
-        <h2>Track Legislation</h2>
-        <div class="steps">
-          <div class="step"><h4>Start at Congress.gov</h4><p>Search by keyword, sponsor, or bill number to find full text and status.</p></div>
-          <div class="step"><h4>Set up alerts</h4><p>Congress.gov lets you save searches and follow specific bills for updates.</p></div>
-          <div class="step"><h4>Read the committee report</h4><p>Committee reports explain intent and often matter more than the bill text alone.</p></div>
-          <div class="step"><h4>Check your state legislature</h4><p>Most states have an equivalent public bill-tracking site — bookmark yours.</p></div>
-        </div>
-      </div>
