+<main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb">Citizen Toolkit</div><h1>Learn how to investigate.</h1><p>Practical field manuals for finding documents, following public systems, and checking a claim without replacing the source.</p><a href="record-builder.html" class="btn">Use a method in a new record →</a></div></section>
